<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4778F0" style="font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Verdana, serif; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F477B50"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F477DB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478010" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478270"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4784D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478730" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478990"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F478E40" style="line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 45px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F4790A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none; height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F479430" style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">The Qantas Fly Well program and our latest updates</span></font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F479690" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none; height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A000" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A700"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47A960" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031794577/QBR+email+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C0E0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C340"><td valign="top" align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47C5A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47CA50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47CCB0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47CF10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47D3D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47D630" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47E210"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47E470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><p data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47E6D0" style="line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 2px; margin-left: 0px;"></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47ECC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47EF20" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Thank you for your time on the phone today, it was great to speak with you again.&nbsp;</span></font></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47F5F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F47F850" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F513750"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F5139B0" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">As discussed, the safety and wellbeing of our customers and people is, and always has been our highest priority.&nbsp;</span></font></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F513E70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F5140D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E3525E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E352840" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">On June 12, we launched our Fly Well program, which brings together a number of temporary and existing wellbeing measures to give you peace-of-mind at each point of your journey.</span></font></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E352D00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E352F60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F24D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2600" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">When you commence flying, you will notice changes to our airport and inflight experience including the provision of hand sanitising wipes and face masks.<br><br>Several resources are available to you and your team, to help you plan and prepare for your next trip with us:&nbsp;<br><ul><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Further information about the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/ar/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/health-while-flying.html?int_cam=ar%3Acoronavirus%3Aarticle%3Afly-well%3Aen%3Ann">Fly Well program</a>,&nbsp;</span></font></font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus.html?int_cam=au%3Aen%3Ahomepage-promotion%3Acoronavirus-travel-update%3Aen%3Aflights#service-updates">Network and scheduling updates</a>,&nbsp;</span></font></font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/program-information/COVID19.html">Coronavirus updates</a> for Qantas Business Rewards members,</span></font></font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/impact-to-lounges.html#lounges">Domestic lounges to reopen</a>, and</span></font></font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/ar/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/frequently-asked-questions.html?int_cam=ar%3Acoronavirus%3Aarticle%3Aneed-more-information-%3Aen%3Ann">Frequently Asked Questions</a>.&nbsp;</span></font></font></li></ul><div>A number of our team members are also available to assist with any of your enquiries.&nbsp;</div></span></font></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2730"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E0F2860" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><br></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9053A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F905600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><br></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F905AC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F905D20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your ongoing support.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9061E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906900"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F906B60" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907010" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907270"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">{!User.Title}</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9074B0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9075C0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas Corporate Sales</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907A60"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Qantas Airways Limited</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907CA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907DB0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F907FF0"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">P. 13 10 85 Ext 36</span></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908230"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">E.&nbsp;</span></font></font><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><u>corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</u></span></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908B70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F908DD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909290"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F9094F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="50" width="307" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2019333048/1710footerQantasOneworldLogo.jpg" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909880"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F909D20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876090" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876550"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8767B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876A10" style="font-weight: bold;">Qantas Privacy Notice</span><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876C70"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E876EB0" style="">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85. To unsubscribe from Qantas updates or marketing offers, contact your Account Manager <a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20updates%20marketing%20offers">here</a> to unsubscribe.</span></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8774A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E877700" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E878E60" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8790C0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879320" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879580" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E8797E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E879A40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E87A150"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002E87A3B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></tabl